# Web3Forms access key — makes the contact form deliver messages to your inbox.
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com and enter eshaanmarocha@gmail.com
# 2. Copy the access key they email you
# 3. Copy this file to `.env` and paste the key below, then rebuild.
# Until this is set, the form falls back to opening the visitor's mail client.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY=
